  </div>
</div>

<h2>How to Calculate Your Dose</h2>

<p>
  Once you know your target ratio, the math is simple. Decide how much coffee you want to brew, then work backwards.
</p>

<div class="calc-visual">
  <div class="calc-card">
    <div class="calc-label">Want 250 ml of coffee?</div>
    <div class="calc-steps">
      <div class="calc-step">
        <span class="calc-step-num">1</span>
        <span>Choose your ratio: <strong>1:15</strong></span>
      </div>
      <div class="calc-step">
        <span class="calc-step-num">2</span>
        <span>Divide water by ratio: <strong>250 ÷ 15 = 16.7g</strong></span>
      </div>
      <div class="calc-step">
        <span class="calc-step-num">3</span>
        <span>Weigh out <strong>16.7g of coffee</strong></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="calc-result">
      <span class="calc-result-label">Your dose</span>
      <span class="calc-result-value">16.7 g</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>Adjusting for Taste</h2>

<p>
  The ratios above are starting points. Here's how to adjust based on what you're tasting:
</p>

<div class="adjust-grid">
  <div class="adjust-card adjust-card--sour">
    <div class="adjust-icon">😖</div>
    <h3>Too Sour / Thin?</h3>
    <p>Your coffee is <strong>under-extracted</strong>. The water didn't pull enough flavour from the grounds.</p>
    <div class="adjust-actions">
      <span class="adjust-action">↓ Use less water (stronger ratio)</span>
      <span class="adjust-action">↓ Grind finer</span>
      <span class="adjust-action">↑ Increase brew time</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="adjust-card adjust-card--bitter">
    <div class="adjust-icon">😬</div>
    <h3>Too Bitter / Harsh?</h3>
    <p>Your coffee is <strong>over-extracted</strong>. Too much flavour was pulled, including unpleasant compounds.</p>
    <div class="adjust-actions">
      <span class="adjust-action">↑ Use more water (weaker ratio)</span>
      <span class="adjust-action">↑ Grind coarser</span>
      <span class="adjust-action">↓ Decrease brew time</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="tip-callout">
  <div class="tip-icon">💡</div>
  <div>
    <strong>Pro tip:</strong> Only change one variable at a time. If you adjust both ratio and grind size simultaneously, you won't know which change made the difference. This is exactly why keeping a brew journal matters — you need the data to iterate.
  </div>
</div>

<h2>Common Mistakes</h2>

<p>
  After helping thousands of people brew better coffee, these are the ratio mistakes we see most often:
</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Measuring coffee by volume instead of weight.</strong> A "scoop" can vary by 30% depending on grind size and how you scoop. Use a scale — even a cheap kitchen scale will transform your consistency.</li>
  <li><strong>Not accounting for water retained in grounds.</strong> Pour-over methods absorb roughly 2x the coffee weight in water. So 15g of coffee absorbs ~30ml. If you pour 225ml, your cup will contain about 195ml.</li>
  <li><strong>Using the same ratio for all roast levels.</strong> Darker roasts are more soluble and extract faster. If you use a 1:15 ratio for a dark roast the same way you would for a light roast, you'll likely over-extract. Try 1:16 or 1:17 for dark roasts.</li>
  <li><strong>Ignoring water quality.</strong> The ratio assumes your water is good. If your tap water tastes off, no ratio will save the brew. Filtered water with a TDS of 75–150 ppm is ideal.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Quick Reference Cards</h2>

<p>Bookmark these for your morning brew:</p>

<div class="quick-ref-grid">
  <div class="quick-ref">
    <div class="qr-header">Single Cup (V60)</div>
    <div class="qr-row"><span>Coffee</span><span class="qr-val">15 g</span></div>
    <div class="qr-row"><span>Water</span><span class="qr-val">225 ml</span></div>
    <div class="qr-row"><span>Ratio</span><span class="qr-val">1:15</span></div>
    <div class="qr-row"><span>Grind</span><span class="qr-val">Medium-fine</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="quick-ref">
    <div class="qr-header">Two Cups (Chemex)</div>
    <div class="qr-row"><span>Coffee</span><span class="qr-val">30 g</span></div>
    <div class="qr-row"><span>Water</span><span class="qr-val">510 ml</span></div>
    <div class="qr-row"><span>Ratio</span><span class="qr-val">1:17</span></div>
    <div class="qr-row"><span>Grind</span><span class="qr-val">Medium-coarse</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="quick-ref">
    <div class="qr-header">French Press</div>
    <div class="qr-row"><span>Coffee</span><span class="qr-val">30 g</span></div>
    <div class="qr-row"><span>Water</span><span class="qr-val">360 ml</span></div>
    <div class="qr-row"><span>Ratio</span><span class="qr-val">1:12</span></div>
    <div class="qr-row"><span>Grind</span><span class="qr-val">Coarse</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="quick-ref">
    <div class="qr-header">Espresso</div>
    <div class="qr-row"><span>Coffee</span><span class="qr-val">18 g</span></div>
    <div class="qr-row"><span>Water</span><span class="qr-val">36–45 ml</span></div>
    <div class="qr-row"><span>Ratio</span><span class="qr-val">1:2–2.5</span></div>
    <div class="qr-row"><span>Grind</span><span class="qr-val">Very fine</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

</GuideLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Key Insight ── */
  .key-insight {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ki-accent {
    width: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--amber), var(--brown));
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ki-body { padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; }

  .ki-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--amber);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .ki-body p {
    margin: 0 !important;
    font-size: 0.95rem !important;
  }

  /* ── Ratio Table ── */
  .ratio-table {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .rt-header, .rt-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 0.8fr 0.8fr 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .rt-header {
    background: var(--dark);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: rgba(250,247,242,0.6);
  }

  .rt-row {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .rt-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .rt-method {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .rt-ratio {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  .rt-bar {
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 3px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .rt-fill {
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--amber), var(--brown));
    border-radius: 3px;
    transition: width 0.6s ease;
  }

  /* ── Calculator Visual ── */
  .calc-visual { margin: 2rem 0; }

  .calc-card {
    background: var(--dark);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 2rem;
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  .calc-label {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  .calc-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .calc-step {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: rgba(250,247,242,0.7);
  }

  .calc-step strong { color: var(--cream); }

  .calc-step-num {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(196,123,48,0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(196,123,48,0.3);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--amber);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .calc-result {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
  }

  .calc-result-label {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: rgba(250,247,242,0.4);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .calc-result-value {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  /* ── Adjust Grid ── */
  .adjust-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .adjust-card {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .adjust-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }

  .adjust-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem !important;
  }

  .adjust-card p {
    font-size: 0.88rem !important;
    margin-bottom: 1rem !important;
  }

  .adjust-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .adjust-action {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    background: var(--cream-subtle);
    padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  /* ── Tip Callout ── */
  .tip-callout {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    background: rgba(196,123,48,0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(196,123,48,0.15);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .tip-icon { font-size: 1.25rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 0.1rem; }

  .tip-callout strong { color: var(--text-dark); }

  /* ── Quick Reference ── */
  .quick-ref-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .quick-ref {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .qr-header {
    background: var(--dark);
    color: var(--cream);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .qr-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0.625rem 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .qr-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .qr-val {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .rt-header, .rt-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    }
    .rt-header span:nth-child(3),
    .rt-header span:nth-child(4),
    .rt-row span:nth-child(3),
    .rt-row span:nth-child(4) { display: none; }

    .adjust-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .quick-ref-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
